  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758549,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: Nightfire - GameCube\n\nStep into the shoes of the iconic James Bond in *James Bond 007: Nightfire* for the Nintendo GameCube! This thrilling first-person shooter plunges you into a globe-trotting adventure as 007 investigates a nefarious industrialist’s plot to dominate the world through a powerful defense satellite. Featuring Pierce Brosnan’s likeness, though voiced by Maxwell Caulfield, you'll utilize a vast arsenal of real-world inspired weaponry – with altered names – to overcome formidable foes.\n\nExperience intense first-person action, engaging single-player missions, and exhilarating multiplayer modes. Navigate diverse environments, utilize Bond’s signature gadgets, and execute daring \"Bond Moments\" to outwit your enemies. While the GameCube version boasts a compelling storyline and impressive character models, be aware that it differs from the PC version, which includes modified missions and removes driving sequences. Prepare for a pulse-pounding experience that captures the essence of the legendary secret agent!"
    },
